{"reviews":[{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-0","r":2.0,"t":"Not right","x":"I have used this product for a long time and alway order it direct from Thrive. In order to save time I order it from Amazon. This is a different mascara. The box came wrapped in plastic and normally it is just a box. The tube and wand looked the same. But  what came from Amazon smudges by the end of the day. ( Normally just peels off no smudging) and I am not getting the same volume and length that I am used too.","h":54,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-1","r":4.0,"t":"Half way true what they claim...","x":"It's good mascara, but it doesn't give the falsie length that they claim it will. Those of you that like false lashes will still want them. It's good enough for a plain Jane like myself though. I purchased mine from the original Thrive company, not Amazon, but still felt compelled to review here to give my fellow addicts my opinion. \ud83d\ude09","h":27,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-2","r":1.0,"t":"This is not waterproof","x":"I ordered the waterproof version of this. NOT waterproof. Had owl eyes after about 10 minutes and actually smudged around my eyes. Ordered the waterproof version because my eyes are moist. And why call it waterproof if it can be taken off with water!","h":13,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-3","r":1.0,"t":"Horrible","x":"Too watery and gets all over your eyes terrible waste of money trash!!!","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-4","r":2.0,"t":"Messy, flaked off","x":"I thought this would be some great mascara considering all the hype and over pricing. Unfortunately, it\u2019s very messy, flaked off and smeared even more to remove it.","h":11,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-5","r":5.0,"t":"Buy directly from Thrive Causemeti","x":"This is the very best mascara I've ever used over 65 years!  The advertising is accurate in every detail; I love it!  However, this 3rd party seller with Amazon charged $34 plus tax with free shipping, and Thrive Causemetics.com charged $24. plus tax with free shipping offered on the weekend. This means that you pay more than $8 (tax is less on $24) buying from the third party seller.  Just sayin'. . .","h":10,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-6","r":5.0,"t":"Incorrect description","x":"This mascara is NOT WATERPROOF for those who have never used it before!  The description is incorrect.  I have been purchasing Thrive mascara for 2 years now from their website and they have not made a waterproof mascara as of yet.  The only thing waterproof from Thrive is their eyeliner. Other than it not being waterproof this is a great lash extension to use.","h":9,"v":0,"d":"Oct 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-7","r":1.0,"t":"Not tubing mascara?","x":"What happened! Did I order the wrong product?? This might as well be Maybeline. I\u2019ve been loving Thrive mascara for over a year because it\u2019s a different kind of tubing formula that just slides off when removed with warm water. But this is not the same formula. This is just regular, runny mascara. Wth??","h":9,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-8","r":2.0,"t":"Not worth the hype","x":"This mascara did not perform the way the ads show.  Not happy with it.","h":8,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-9","r":1.0,"t":"No funciona para mi","x":"Bueno en cuanto a mi respondo que no me funciono. Tengo pocas pesta\u00f1as, las enchufe antes de poner la m\u00e1scara y el resultado desastroso. El producto hizo que mis pesta\u00f1as perdieran el volumen del encrespado horrible.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-10","r":5.0,"t":"Finally\u2026","x":"I\u2019m constantly looking for a good mascara. I have straight, very fair lashes so it\u2019s hard to find one that looks good without clumping. Although it doesn\u2019t make your lashes longer than they are, it does make the absolute most of the lashes you do. Goes on easily, 2nd coat goes on smooth and evenly without clumps. Looks great and comes off easily when you\u2019re ready to remove. I\u2019ve finally ended my search.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-11","r":1.0,"t":"Not as stated","x":"Although they advertised this item as waterproof- no where on the item does it say waterproof & when I tested it, it absolutely wasn\u2019t.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-12","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect lashes everytime","x":"Love ! Love! Love! A little pricey but worth it.","h":4,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-13","r":3.0,"t":"Clumpy","x":"Extends your lashes but if there clump together your in trouble separating them. It's like black goo on your lashes. Very heavy and hard to take off.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-14","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the price.","x":"The mascara doesn\u2019t make a noticeable difference.  Especially for the price and hype.  The waterproof liner, comes off easily, while showering.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-15","r":4.0,"t":"It was ok","x":"Mascara was okay but I didn't notice a big difference in making the lashes longer than other mascaras.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-16","r":1.0,"t":"Bottle dry inside.","x":"Bottle dry inside. Had to get a refund.","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-17","r":2.0,"t":"Don\u2019t waste your money","x":"This mascara does not live up to the hype do not waste your money it does not make you have long lashes you can\u2019t get something better for half the price at all chat don\u2019t bother","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-18","r":1.0,"t":"Not good","x":"This mascara runs clumps and smears is very difficult to remove. You must be very patient to use this product.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-19","r":3.0,"t":"Great product","x":"I think the the tube I received was old and nearly dried out. It didn't last very long maybe a month","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2023"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-20","r":2.0,"t":"Not worth the miney","x":"Not worth the money, and doesn't work. Never use or waste money or time again","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2021"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-21","r":5.0,"t":"Best mascara","x":"Best mascara I have used in a long time. Doesn\u2019t flake or smudge. I love it!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-22","r":5.0,"t":"Love this product!","x":"From short lashes to long and natural looking!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-23","r":3.0,"t":"Not waterproof as advertised by this seller","x":"Do not label it waterproof mascara when it isn\u2019t.  Waterproof mascara is something you can swim in. This mascara will flake off in water.  It doesn\u2019t smear but it does flake off. Great mascara if you don\u2019t need waterproof","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Mar 2022"},{"id":"B09GTV6WL6-24","r":4.0,"t":"Adds Volume to lashes.","x":"For that price I could buy Lancome the best mascara which I\u2019ve used all my life. Easy to remove, I wash my face with warm water first including mascara, then Clinic eye make-up cleaner (Amazon), wipe it off easy.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Apr 2022"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Several reviewers report the product is not waterproof despite being advertised as such, with smudging and removal by water.","cites":[3,7,12]},{"text":"Some reviewers say the mascara is messy, runny, clumpy, or flakes off.","cites":[4,5,8,14]},{"text":"Multiple reviewers feel the product does not live up to its advertising or hype, particularly regarding length.","cites":[2,9,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers praise the mascara, saying it goes on easily and makes the most of their lashes.","cites":[6,11,13]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the product is pricey or overpriced.","cites":[6,13,15]}]},"qa":[]}